                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-09-27">September 27,
                            1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee asks what action has been taken concerning customs at Newchwang, in
                    pursuance of department’s telegram of August 30.)</p>
            </div>
